  <section class="about-story shell" aria-label="My story">
    <article class="about-chapter about-origin"><p class="section-label">Hamburg / Before Delaware</p><div><h2>Change the explanation.<br />Keep the standard.</h2><p class="about-origin-line">A six-year-old and a sixteen-year-old don’t need the same explanation.</p><p>At Walddörfer SV, I coached children and teenagers. That taught me to adjust how I communicate to the person in front of me. Outside work, I’m drawn to basketball, travel, and conversations that take me beyond my own perspective. I speak German, English, and French.</p></div></article>
    <article class="about-chapter"><p class="section-label">Delaware / Now</p><div><h2>Get past the pitch.</h2><p>I want to understand what makes a client act, explain complex ideas clearly, and earn trust when it matters. At the University of Delaware, I’m studying entrepreneurship with minors in Professional Sales &amp; Sales Management and Marketing. I expect to graduate in Fall 2028.</p></div></article>
    <article class="about-chapter"><p class="section-label">Putting it to work</p><div><h2>Put it under pressure.</h2><p>The Lerner Sales Competition put me in a simulated client conversation, where I finished as a Top 20 semi-finalist. At Horbach, I supported lead qualification and saw how experienced advisors approached client needs. Co-founding STRK gives me something of my own to build and test.</p><a class="inline-link" href="/work/">Explore the work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article>
  </section>

  <section class="about-next shell"><div><p class="section-label">What’s next</p><h2>A sales team<br />to grow with.</h2></div><div><p>I’m seeking a U.S. B2B sales, SDR, or BDR internship where I can learn quickly and contribute early.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/#contact">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
